                "status": "Continuing",
                "description": "Trials that have shocked public opinion in Hollywood and in \"real life\". Pour yourself a cup of tea, sit comfortable on the sofa. On Tuesdays, in the section Un Tè in magistrate's court, we deal with trials and judicial cases that have shocked the Italian and international scene. On Thursdays we deal with trials and scandals in the world of Hollywood, that facade of fame and luxury very often hides scabrous stories and, sometimes, even crimes. I wouldn't call myself a True Crime channel because everything we tell is based on trial papers: prosecution and defense are the protagonists of our stories. We can spread a new hashtag, TRUE PROCESS."
